<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-EMV WINS ESTIKO CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-EMV WINS ESTIKO CONSTRUCTION CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMV was selected to build the first stage of the Emajogi commercial centre, Estiko said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The contract is worth 69.5 million kroons plus value added tax with the agreement to be finalised by September 15, Estiko said in a statement.</p>
<p>EMV won the contact from a field of five construction companies.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
